9: AVDD=3V3_SENS; program 2V8 IO mode with ST driver.\nXSHUT open-drain control only. DNC pin8 intentionally open. Aperture faces upward: mount board to suit sensing direction.\nUltrasonic VCC is battery-derived BAT5: USB-only operation does not power 5V accessories.\nEcho uses 5.5V-tolerant SN74LVC1G17 input; no direct 5V enters ESP32." (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "efbb80c5-97cd-474b-92a4-094f70c9a901")) (embedded_fonts no))
